=== Text #1 ===
> NicQu[id Bahama] Blizzard will rival any frozen tropical cocktail[.] Better[ than] sitting on a beach with a breeze in your hair[.] It is a perfect paring of orange, cranberry and peach which is blended and frozen with cool sweet menthol[.] NicQuip[:] The basic recipe for a Daiqu[irí] is also similar to the grog[ British] sailors were rationed aboard ship from the 1740s onwards[. You] may also have[ to] ration NicQu[id] Bah[ama] Blizzard[ before] you vape it all up[!]

